KnobWireless 1.0.0

This library intentionally distributes src/esp32p4/libKnobWireless.a as a
runtime dependency. Its source versions are ESP-IDF v5.5.5 (Wi-Fi and
Bluetooth Bluedroid) and esp-extconn 0.3.3; its maintainable build basis is
ESP32-P4 postv3 with a 1000 Hz FreeRTOS tick configuration. It is used with
the unmodified Arduino-ESP32 3.3.12 core and does not replace the core SDK or
its sdkconfig.

The archive contains ESP-IDF Wi-Fi host support, esp-extconn, and the
Bluetooth Bluedroid host with BLE and A2DP/SBC support. The reviewable facade
ABI sources are retained at src/backend/facade.c and src/backend/bt_facade.c.
library.properties uses precompiled=full, so Arduino uses the matching archive
instead of compiling those sources against a different SDK.

